// Onboards SV_MONTHLY_TRENDS (pre-aggregated time-series view over
// V_MONTHLY_REVENUE) and exercises a time-intelligence shape: filter to one
// YEAR, group by YEAR_MONTH, project both the period metric and the
// pre-computed year-to-date cumulative metric.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS(
    SV_MONTHLY_TRENDS[YEAR_MONTH],
    FILTER(ALL(SV_MONTHLY_TRENDS[YEAR]), SV_MONTHLY_TRENDS[YEAR] = 1997),
    "Monthly Revenue", SUM(SV_MONTHLY_TRENDS[MONTHLY_REVENUE]),
    "Cumulative YTD", SUM(SV_MONTHLY_TRENDS[CUMULATIVE_YTD])
)
ORDER BY SV_MONTHLY_TRENDS[YEAR_MONTH]
